From 03de138980703c5c41064759cb6cbbdaf855d7b9 Mon Sep 17 00:00:00 2001
From: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
Date: Mon, 14 Oct 2024 08:37:33 +0300
Subject: [PATCH] [SW-205285] gaudi3: change the mgmt iccm reloc addr

Changing mgmt iccm reloc address to DIE1 ARC1 ICCM.

Change-Id: Iaddb3cb9da53cff713c0615ae639a94f6ed118d0
Signed-off-by: chandavath <rcrajagopal@habana.ai>
